{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Even an ordinary day can mark the beginning of a new path of training. Yuro sets out from the jinja, wielding swordsmanship and onmyo magic to safeguard the future.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aMiko Yuro: Training Record\u300bis the sequel to the Japanese-style adventure game\u300aYuro's Fantasy Adventure\u300b, depicting the growth and trials of Yuro several years later, as a jinja miko of Kanai Jinja, she shoulders the responsibility of inheriting the future of the shrine and begins a new training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of Yuro from a third-person perspective, honing her skills through the use of katana, fan, and onmyo magic, her training unfolds across various themed stages, including the jinja, sando, village, and city.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912940?t=1754107210","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912940/ed754bff4211a93f13248458e879c57132bfb809/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754107210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912940/f0f2a1a2ec71920f739103b9697879db147cd1b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754107210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912940/f0f2a1a2ec71920f739103b9697879db147cd1b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754107210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Even an ordinary day can mark the beginning of a new path of training. Yuro sets out from the jinja, wielding swordsmanship and onmyo magic to safeguard the future.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aMiko Yuro: Training Record\u300bis the sequel to the Japanese-style adventure game\u300aYuro's Fantasy Adventure\u3